{"event":"changes_requested","job_id":"docs-point-of-sale-pre-authorisation","reason":"The trusted SHA-256 matches the full 1,039-line pinned raw. The candidate accurately identifies the POS Terminal API origin, backend amount adjustment and capture, asynchronous webhook outcomes, synchronous blob fallback, method/MCC/issuer limits, and the Visa 5542 conflict. All five quotes are exact at their stated raw lines; the detail locators and proposed reciprocal routes resolve against the existing concepts. Three retained statements need narrow qualification before promotion. The first two affect answers to the fixed capability and expiry queries; the third would remove an established eligibility boundary from the main concept. Catalog insertion remains coordinator-owned."}
